<Base lang="en" title="About the club" description="About the KUAS Photography Club: members, regular meetings, dues and organizers.">
  <PageHero edge="ABOUT ▸ KUAS PHOTOGRAPHY CLUB" title="About the club" lead="We are the photography club at Kyoto University of Advanced Science. This website is operated by the club. We enjoy photography and connect through a shared interest, across nationalities and experience levels." />
  <section class="wrap"><ClubFacts lang="en" /></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap prose">
    <h2>Enjoy photography together</h2><p>Beginners and experienced photographers are welcome to visit. You can take part with a smartphone. Members plan photo outings together; confirmed dates are listed in the <a href="/en/schedule/">schedule</a>.</p>
    <h2>Shared equipment</h2><p>Shared cameras and other equipment are still being prepared. Ask the organizers what is available.</p>
    <h2>Organizers</h2><p>The club has a president, vice president and treasurer. <a href="/en/contact/">Contact the organizers</a> about activities or visiting.</p>
  </div></section>
</Base>
